Maintainer: Albrecht Gebhardt <albrecht.gebhardt@aau.at>
Description: 
  This package aims to provide easy access to OpenCL coding 
  using a C++ abstraction layer via classes inherited from 
  OpenCL-Wrapper <https://github.com/ProjectPhysX/OpenCL-Wrapper>
  by Dr. Moritz Lehmann to interact with low level OpenCL functions. 
  Configuration is done automatically via CMake based on
  J. Maertes template package from which this package is a
  fork of, see <https://github.com/jmaerte/cmake-rcpp-template>). 
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Imports: Rcpp
SystemRequirements: OpenCL, CMake
Encoding: UTF-8
